<title>GERMANY: Veba expands cable TV with acquisition.</title>
<headline>Veba expands cable TV with acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German-British telecommunications group Vebacom GmbH on Monday confirmed press reports from the weekend that it would expand its cable television activities by purchasing Urbana Systemtechnik AG.</p>
<p>Vebacom, a joint venture of energy group Veba AG and British telecoms group Cable and Wireless, said the acquisition would boost its share of Germany's cable television market to 10 percent from seven percent currently.</p>
